<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">RRK55.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">1 TIMOSEO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ebaruha y'okubanza ei Paulo yaahandiikiire Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoseo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">EBARUHA Y'OKUBANZA EI PAULO YAAHANDIIKIIRE</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOSEO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Nyowe Paulo, entumwa ya Kristo Yesu ahabw'okuragiirwa Ruhanga Omujuni waitu, na Kristo Yesu amatsiko gaitu, <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />naakuhandiikira, Timoseo omwana wangye buzima omu kwikiriza; ninkwendeza embabazi n'okusaasirwa n'obusingye ebirikuruga ahari Ruhanga Isheboona na Kristo Yesu Mukama waitu.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okumuragiira eby'omurimo gwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Ku naabaire ninza Makedonia, nkatsiga naakwehanangiriza ku oguma Efeso, ngu obone kuhana abantu bamwe barekye kwegyesa endiijo nyegyesa, <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:7">1 Tim 4:7</ref>. </char></note> n'okuhugira aha nfumu z'ebigunjano, n'okutondoora obukomooko bwa baishenkurubo obutaine bugarukiro, ebirikuzaarukwamu empaka, bitarikugasira murimo gwa Ruhanga oguri omu kwikiriza; <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 13:10">Rom 13:10</ref>. </char></note> haza ekigyendererwa omu kwegyesa kwaitu n'okukunda okurikuruga aha mutima ogushemeire n'omwoyo ogutarikweshinja n'okwikiriza okutarimu buryarya. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Hariho abantu bamwe abateishukire ebyo, bakahabira omu mpaka ezitaine mugasho, <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />nibenda kuba abeegyesa b'Ebiragiro, haza batarikwetegyereza ki barikugamba, n'obu byakuba ebi barikuhamya.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 7:12">Rom 7:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka itwe nitumanya ngu Ebiragiro ni birungi, omuntu yaaba naabikoresa nk'oku bishemereire, <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />naashoborokyerwa ngu Ebiragiro tibiratairweho habw'abahikiriire, kureka ahabw'abagomi n'abatarikuhurira, ahabw'abatatiina Ruhanga n'abasiisi, ahabw'abatarikwera n'abateeta ha bya Ruhanga, ahabw'abaita baishebo na baanyinabo, n'abaitsi b'abandi, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />n'abashambani, n'abashaija abakorana eby'enshoni, n'abanyaga abantu bakabatunda, n'ababeihi, n'abarahira ebishuba, n'ebindi byona ebirikurwanisa enyegyesa ehikire, <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />erikukuratira engiri y'ekitiinisa eya Ruhanga orikusiimwa, ei naakwatsiibwe.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Paulo okusiima Ruhanga ahabw'okujunwa kwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 1:13-16">Gal 1:13-16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ninsiima Kristo Yesu Mukama waitu owampaire amaani, ahabw'okuba akanteekateekaho kuba omwesigwa, yampa omurimo gw'okumuheereza, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />n'obu ndaabe obunyakare naamurogotsireho, nkamujuma, ndi omuntu enshaarizi; kwonka nkasaasirwa ahabw'okubikorera omu butamanya n'omu butaikiriza; <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />kandi embabazi za Mukama waitu zikaba nyingi munonga ahariinye hamwe n'okwikiriza n'okukunda okuri omuri Kristo Yesu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:10">Luk 19:10</ref>. </char></note> Ekigambo eki n'eky'okwesigwa, kishemereire kwikiririzibwa kimwe, ngu Kristo Yesu akaija omu nsi kujuna abasiisi; kandi omuri abo niinye w'okubanza; <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />kwonka eki naasaasiriirwe, Yesu Kristo akenda kworekyera omuriinye, omusiisi w'okubanza, eky'okureeberaho ahari abo abarimwikiriza kutunga amagara agatahwaho. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Mukama otahwaho, otafa, otareebwa, Ruhanga Nyamuhanga, aheebwe ekitiinisa, ahimbisibwe ebiro n'ebiro. Amiina. <verse eid="1TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JUD 1:3">Yud 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Omurimo ogwo naagukukwatsa, Timoseo mwana wangye, nk'ebi baanabi baabire bakugambireho, ngu bikwezirikise kurwana okurwana okurungi, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:10">1 Tim 6:10</ref>. </char></note> noohamya okwikiriza n'omutima murungi ogutarikweshinja, ogu abamwe baanagire hare, bakasiisikarirwa okwikiriza kwabo nk'obwato oku bufeera omu nyanja. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 5:5">1 Kor 5:5</ref>. </char></note> Omuri abo ni Humenaayo na Alegizanda, abu naarekyeire Sitaane, ngu bakaayega okutarogota.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize y'Okushaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 4:6">Fil 4:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eky'okubanza, nimbeehanangiriza kushabira abantu boona, n'okubeeshengyerereza, n'okubatonganira, n'okubasiimira Ruhanga; <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />mushabire abagabe n'abategyeki boona tubone kugira obusingye tutebeekane, nitutiina Ruhanga kandi nitwerinda omu buryo bwona. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Eki nikyo kirungi kandi ekishemeire omu maisho ga Ruhanga Omujuni waitu, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:34">Yer 31:34</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 3:9">2 Pet 3:9</ref>. </char></note> oyenda ngu abantu boona bajunwe, bamanyire kimwe amazima; <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:24">Heb 12:24</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba hariho Ruhanga omwe, kandi n'Omuteerani omwe owa Ruhanga n'abantu, ogwo muntu ni Kristo Yesu, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:4">Gal 1:4</ref>. </char></note> owaayehaireyo kuba ow'okucungura abantu boona. Ebyo bikahamibwa omu bunaku bwabyo; <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:11">2 Tim 1:11</ref>. </char></note> nyowe nkateebwaho kuba omubuurizi waabyo kandi entumwa, (ningamba amazima, tindikubeiha), n'omwegyesa w'Abanyamahanga kubeegyesa okwikiriza n'amazima.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize eshemereire abakazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />N'ahabw'ekyo niinyenda ngu abashaija babe nibo baashaba omu myanya yoona, nibaimutsya emikono erikwera bataine kiniga nari empaka. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3-5">1 Pet 3:3-5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abakazi bo bagume beecume, bajware ebijwaro ebibashemereire, baine obucureezi n'okwerinda, barekye kutsiba eishokye, n'obu kwakuba okujwara ezaabu nari eruuru nari ebijwaro by'obuguzi bwingi, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />kureka bakore emirimo mirungi eshemereire abakazi abeeyeta abarikutiina Ruhanga. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Omukazi agume ayegye ahunami omu kworoba kwona. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:34">1 Kor 14:34</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba tindikwikiriza mukazi kubuurira nari kutegyeka abashaija; kureka agume ahunami. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Ahakuba Adamu niwe yaabandize kuhangwa, haakurataho Haawa; <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:3">2 Kor 11:3</ref>. </char></note> kandi Adamu tiwe yaabeihabeihirwe, kureka omukazi niwe yaabeihabeihirwe, akahinduka omusiisi. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Kwonka omukazi ku ariguma omu kwikiriza, omu kukunda, omu kwera, hamwe n'omu kwerinda, aryaguma atabaarukye gye omu kuzaara abaana.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize eshemereire abareeberezi n'abadiikoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:28">Byak 20:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekigambo eki n'eky'amazima. Omuntu ku ayenda omurimo gw'omureeberezi, aba akunzire omurimo murungi. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:6">Tit 1:6</ref>, <ref loc="TIT 1:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Mumanye ngu omureeberezi ashemereire kutagira ki arikugaywaho, omushaija oine omukazi omwe, omwerinzi, omunyabwengye, omukwata mpora, orikukunira abagyenyi, orikurahukirwa kwegyesa, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />otarikusinda, otarikurwana, kureka orikutwaza gye, otarikutongana, otarikukunda mpiiha, <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:23">1 Sam 2:23</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 2:24">24</ref>. </char></note> orikutegyeka gye eka ye, ou abaana be barikworobera bakamuha ekitiinisa omu miringo yoona; <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />(omuntu otarikumanya kutegyeka ab'omu ka ye, naabaasa ata kutegyeka ekanisa ya Ruhanga?) <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Tashemereire kuba Mukristaayo musya, obundi atakaayetunguura, akagwa, akacwerwa orubanja nk'oru Sitaane yaacwereirwe; <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 8:21">2 Kor 8:21</ref>. </char></note> kandi ashemereire kuba orikusiimwa ab'aheeru, arekye kujumwa n'okugwa omu mutego gwa Sitaane.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Kandi abadiikoni nabo bashemereire kuba abeerinzi abatarikugambira habiri, abatarikunywa viinyo nyingi, abatarikwetenga nshaagi, <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />abarikurinda enaama y'okwikiriza, abaine omutima ogutarikweshinja. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Kandi abo babanze bagyezibwe; ku baraashangwe bataine ki barikugaywaho, babone kukora omurimo gw'obudiikoni. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 2:3">Tit 2:3</ref>. </char></note> Abadiikoni nabo bashemereire kuba abeerinzi, abatarikubeiherera bandi, abatarikukunda birikusinza, kandi abeesigwa omuri byona. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Abadiikoni babe abashaija abaine omukazi omwe, abarikutegyeka gye abaana baabo n'abamaka gaabo; <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />ahakuba abaheereza gye omu murimo gw'obudiikoni beetungira eiziina rirungi n'obumanzi bwingi omu kwikiriza okuri omuri Kristo Yesu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 5:9">1 Kor 5:9</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 5:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyine amatsiko g'okwija okwo juba; kwonka naakuhandiikira ebyo, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />ngu, ku ndiba ntarahukire kwija, omanye oku abantu bashemereire kutwaza omu nju ya Ruhanga, niyo kanisa ya Ruhanga ohuriire, enyomyo kandi obuhamizo bw'amazima. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:19">Mak 16:19</ref>. </char></note> Kandi tihariho kubanganisa, enaama y'ediini yaitu ku eri nkuru buzima, erikugira eti: Akoorekwa aine omubiri, yaahamibwa Omwoyo, yaareebwa baamaraika, yaabuurirwa omu mahanga, yaikirizibwa ab'omu nsi, yaatwarwa omu iguru kutaaha omu kitiinisa.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Okurwanisa enyegyesa y'ebishuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 3:1">2 Tim 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:18">Yud 1:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Omwoyo naagamba butunu ati: Omu biro ebya bwanyima bamwe baryareka okwikiriza ahabw'okuhurira emyoyo erikuhabya n'okwegyesa kwa baadaimoni, <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />bahabisibwe oburyarya bw'abantu abarikubeiha ebishuba, abaine emitima etakihurira, nk'esiriiziibwe ekyoma ekirukwotsya, <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 10:31">1 Kor 10:31</ref>. </char></note> abaziza okushwera, kandi eby'okurya ebi Ruhanga yaahangiire abarikwikiriza bakamanya amazima ngu babyakiire n'okusiima. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:15">Byak 10:15</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba eki Ruhanga yaahangire kyona ni kirungi; kandi tihariho kirikuzira, ku kiba kyakiirwe n'okusiima; <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />ahakuba nikiba kyeziibwe ekigambo kya Ruhanga n'okushaba.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Emitwarize eshemereire abaheereza ba Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ku orishobororera ab'eishe-emwe ebigambo ebyo, oryaguma ori omuheereza murungi wa Kristo Yesu, orikutungwa ebigambo by'okwikiriza n'eby'enyegyesa nungi ei waakuratiire. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:14">Tit 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 3:9">3:9</ref>. </char></note> Ebiteekyerezo by'ebigunjano eby'abakaikuru, ebitari bya Ruhanga, otaribiikiriza. Yemanyiize okutiina Ruhanga; <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 6:6">1 Tim 6:6</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba okwemanyiiza eby'omubiri nikugasha kakye, kwonka okwemanyiiza okutiina Ruhanga nikugasha omu muringo gwona, ahakuba kwine eki kuturaganisa aha magara g'ebiro ebi n'ag'ebiro ebiriija. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Ekigambo ekyo n'eky'okwesigwa, kandi kishemereire kwikiririzibwa kimwe. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:3">1 Tim 2:3</ref>, <ref loc="1TI 2:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo tufeera kubi, kandi nikyo twezirikira, ahakuba twesiga Ruhanga ohuriire, Omujuni w'abantu boona, na buzima ow'abarikwikiriza.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Ebyo obiragiire kandi obyegyese. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Hatagira owaagaya obutsigazi bwawe, kureka obe eky'okureeberaho aha barikwikiriza omu kugamba n'omu mitwarize, omu kukunda, omu kwikiriza n'omu kugira omutima ogushemeire. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Oyezirikye kushomera abantu Ebyahandiikirwe, n'okubuurira, n'okwegyesa, okuhitsya obu ndiija. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 5:22">1 Tim 5:22</ref>. </char></note> Otarireka kukoresa ekiconco eki oine, eki waahairwe ahabw'ebi waagambirweho baanabi, obu abakuru baakutaho engaro. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Ebyo obyezirikire, obe nibyo waataho omutima, boona bareebe oku orikweyongyera kugyenda omu maisho. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Oyerinde iwe wenka, kandi n'omu bi orikwegyesa. Ogumizemu n'ebyo; ahakuba omu kukora otyo, noija kwejuna, kandi ojune n'abarikukuhurira.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Okuteisa okurungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:32">Lev 19:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otariteisa omushaija mukuru n'amaani, kureka omuhuguure nka sho; abatsigazi obatwaze nka barumuna baawe, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />abakazi bakuru nka nyoko, abakazi bato n'abaishiki nka banyaanyoko, obaineho omutima ogushemeire.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'abafaakazi abakuru n'abato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Abafaakazi enshoberwa buzima obahe ekitiinisa. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Omufaakazi, ku araabe aine abaana nari abaijukuru, babanze beegye kworeka okutiina Ruhanga kwabo omu bi barikukorera ab'omu maka gaabo, nibaihura ebi abazaire baabo baabakoreire, ahabw'okuba ekyo nikyo kishemeire omu maisho ga Ruhanga. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:37">Luk 2:37</ref>; <ref loc="JER 49:11">Yer 49:11</ref>. </char></note> Omufaakazi enshoberwa ata amatsiko ahari Ruhanga, aguma naashaba naayeshengyereza nyomushana na nyekiro; <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />kwonka oyehayo kweshemeza, aba afiire n'obu aba ahuriire. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Obaragiire otyo, barekye kugira eki barikugaywaho. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Kwonka omuntu weena, otarikuhwera banyabuzaare, n'okukira munonga ab'omu ka ye, biri ayehakaine okwikiriza, kandi naaba ari mubi okukira otarikwikiriza.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Hatarigira omufaakazi owaabarirwa omu b'okuhwerwa atakahikize myaka makumi mukaaga ey'obukuru, kandi ashemereire kuba omukazi owaashweirwe omushaija omwe, <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:14">Yoh 13:14</ref>. </char></note> kandi orikusiimwa ahabw'emirimo mirungi, owaakurize gye abaana be, owaabaire akunira abagyenyi, akanaabisa ebigyere by'abarikwera, akahwera abarikushaasha, kandi owaayehaireyo kukora ebirungi omu muringo gwona. <verse eid="1TI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Kwonka abafaakazi abakiri bato otariikiriza kubataasya omu mutwe gw'abafaakazi, ahakuba ku baremwa kwerinda n'okworobera Kristo, benda kushwerwa; <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />batyo basingwa orubanja, ahabw'okwita endagaano yaabo ey'okubanza. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 3:11">2 Tes 3:11</ref>. </char></note> N'ekindi beega obweremwa, basiiba nibabungyeera omu maka; kandi ti bweremwa bwonka, kureka baba ab'okubuzya orukuru, beetaasya omu bitari byabo, nibagamba ebitabashemereire. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 7:9">1 Kor 7:9</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ninkunda ngu abafaakazi abakiri bato bashwerwe, bazaare abaana, bombekye amaka gaabo, barekye kuha abazigu obwiho bw'okutujuma. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Ahakuba na hati hariho bamwe abahabire bakakuratira Sitaane. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Omukazi weena orikwikiriza ku araabe aine abafaakazi abanyabuzaare, abe niwe yaabahwera, barekye kurusya ekanisa, ebone kuhwera abafaakazi enshoberwa.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PHP 2:29">Fil 2:29</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abakuru abarikutegyeka gye bateekateekweho kuba abashemereire kuheebwa ekitiinisa kingi okukira abandi, na buzima abarikukora omurimo gw'okubuurira n'okwegyesa; <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Bir 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 9:9">1 Kor 9:9</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba Ebyahandiikirwe biragiira biti: Otariboha akanwa k'ente erikujunga engano. Kandi biti: Omukozi ashemereire ebihembo bye.<verse eid="1TI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 19:15">Bir 19:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat 18:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Otariikiriza ekirego kyona aha mukuru, kureka kyahamibwa baamushinja babiri nari bashatu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:14">Gal 2:14</ref>. </char></note> Abo abakozire ekibi ogume obateisize omu maisho ga boona, n'abandi babone kutiina. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Ninkwehanangiriza omu maisho ga Ruhanga na Kristo Yesu na baamaraika abaatoorainwe, oyerinde ebyo biragiro, okutagira rubaju ru waagwera, n'obu kwakuba okukorera omuntu weena ekintu ahabw'obuganzi. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Otarirahukiriza kuta engaro aha muntu weena, n'obu kwakuba okukwatanisa n'abandi omu bibi; oyerinde ogume ori oshemeire.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Okuruga hati otarinywa amaizi gonka; kureka onywe viinyo nkye ahabw'enda yaawe, n'ahabw'okurwararwara kwawe.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Ebibi by'abantu abamwe nibireebwa butunu, biri eby'okureeta orubanja; kwonka eby'abandi bireebwa bwanyima. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Okwo nikwo n'emirimo mirungi ereebwa butunu; kwonka n'obu biba bitari bityo, tibibaasa kuguma bisherekirwe.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 2:9">Tit 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="TIT 2:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Abahuuku boona abarikutegyekwa bamanye bakama baabo ku bashemereire kuheebwa ekitiinisa, buzima, eiziina rya Ruhanga n'enyegyesa yaitu birekye kujumwa. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:16">Film 1:16</ref>. </char></note> Abaine bakama baabo abarikwikiriza bataribagaya ngu niho bari ab'eishe-emwe; kureka bakizeho okubakorera gye, ahabw'okuba abaine omugisha gw'okuheerezibwa okwo n'abantu abarikwikiriza kandi abarikukundwa. Ebyo guma obyegyese kandi obyehanangirize abantu.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugasho gw'okutiina Ruhanga n'obubi bw'okukunda empiiha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 1:6-9">Gal 1:6-9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuntu weena oyegyesa okundi, akahakanisa ebigambo by'amazima ebya Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo n'enyegyesa erikwikirizana n'okutiina Ruhanga, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />aba ayekurize, kandi ataine ki arikumanya; arwaire endwara y'empaka n'okuhakana aha bigambo, ezirugwamu eihari n'okutongana n'okugambuurana n'okurengyerera, <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 3:8">2 Tim 3:8</ref>. </char></note> n'empaka z'abantu abasiisikaire obwengye, abaihiirweho amazima, nibateekateeka ngu okutiina Ruhanga n'oburyo bw'okutunga enshaagi. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 4:11">Fil 4:11</ref>, <ref loc="PHP 4:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Haza kunu okutiina Ruhanga, okurimu okumarwa, kurimu enshaagi nyingi; <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 5:15">Mub 5:15</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba titurareetsire kintu mu nsi, kandi titurikubaasa kwihamu kintu; <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 30:8">Enf 30:8</ref>. </char></note> ku turaabe twine eby'okurya n'eby'okujwara, ebyo bigume bitumare. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 28:22">Enf 28:22</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abeetenga kuba abatungi bagwa omu kwohibwa n'omu mutego n'omu kwetenga kwingi kw'obushema okurikushiisha, kukaroha abantu omu kuconcoboza n'okuhwerekyerera. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Ahakuba okwetenga empiiha n'omuzi gw'ebibi byona; hariho bamwe abaagiriire ebyo omururu, bakahaba, bakaruga omu kwikiriza, bakeecumitira kimwe n'enaku nyingi.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Kwonka iwe omuntu wa Ruhanga, oyetantare ebyo; okuratire okuhikiirira n'okutiina Ruhanga, okwikiriza, okukunda, okugumisiriza, n'obucureezi. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:25">1 Kor 9:25</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 9:26">26</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:7">2 Tim 4:7</ref>. </char></note> Rwana okurwana okurungi okw'okwikiriza, ohamize kimwe amagara agatahwaho, agu waayeteirwe, obu waagamba butunu okuhamya okurungi omu maisho ga baakareebi baingi. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Ninkwehanangiriza omu maisho ga Ruhanga oha ebintu byona amagara, na Kristo Yesu, owaahamize okuhamya okurungi omu maisho ga Pontio Pilaato, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />oyorobere ekiragiro otaine kamogo, kandi otaine ki orikugaywaho okuhitsya aha kworekwa kwa Mukama waitu Yesu Kristo, <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 17:14">Kush 17:14</ref>. </char></note> okuryorekwa omu bunaku bwakwo, Omutegyeki ogwo orikusiimwa omwe wenka, Omugabe w'abagabe, Omukama w'abakama, <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />niwe wenka oine okutafa, otuura omu mushana ogutahikwaho, otakareebwaga muntu weena, kandi otabaasa kureebwa. Ekitiinisa n'obutegyeki obutahwaho bibe ebye. Amiina.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuhabura abatungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 62:10">Zab 62:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:20">Luk 12:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ebirikukwata aha batungi b'ensi egi, obeehanangirize barekye kwemanya, nari kwegamiza amatsiko gaabo aha butungi obutarikwesigwa, kureka bagagire ahari Ruhanga, otuha byona atarikubariirira, ngu tubishemerererwe. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Kandi bakore ebirungi, babe abatungi omu micwe mirungi, babe efura omu kugaba, bagire omutima gw'okukwatanisa n'abandi; <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />batyo beebiikire obutungi obu baryegamira omu biro ebiriija, babone kutunga amagara aga buzima.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 1:14">2 Tim 1:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyabura 'we Timoseo, rinda eki waakwatsiibwe, oyetantare ebigambo by'okuregyeta eby'okutatiina Ruhanga, n'empaka z'ebigambo by'ebi beeta obwengye, haza butari bwo; <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />ahakuba bamwe ahabw'okwegira ngu babwine, bakahaba baaruga omu kwikiriza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Embabazi zigume naimwe. Amiina.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>